Andy Grimm write:
>  [information about getting save and bones files
>   to be available to everybody]

Set up the game in an account with no real special
privledges and do a 'setuid' (chmod 7555 nethack)
When anybody runs nethack, they will run as if they
were logged in as the owner of the file 'nethack'
All the bones files and save games will be owned by 
this person.

The reason not to give the file to an important account
(like root) is because if the program isn't perfectly secure
it will alow users access to that account.

